@startuml flash-booking-external-confirmation-aws
' Diagramas editáveis. Ícones AWS oficiais da standard library do PlantUML.
!include <awslib/AWSCommon.puml>
!include <awslib/Containers/ElasticContainerService.puml>
!include <awslib/Database/RDS.puml>
!include <awslib/ApplicationIntegration/SimpleQueueService.puml>

title Confirmação externa — a outbox persiste; a SQS transporta
autonumber 1 1
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 105
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam defaultFontSize 15

actor "Cliente / API caller" as client
box "Flash Booking · AWS declarada em Terraform, ainda não aplicada" #EAF3FA
participant "Command API\n$ElasticContainerServiceIMG()" as api
participant "PostgreSQL RDS\n$RDSIMG()\nreserva · outbox · inbox" as db
participant "Worker ECS Fargate\n$ElasticContainerServiceIMG()" as worker
participant "reservation-to-owner\nAmazon SQS\n$SimpleQueueServiceIMG()" as toOwner
participant "reservation-from-owner\nAmazon SQS\n$SimpleQueueServiceIMG()" as fromOwner
end box
box "Outro sistema · responsável único; caixa-preta" #FFF3E3
participant "Responsável por todas\nas pendências\n(não implementado aqui)" as owner
end box

== Criar a reserva temporária ==
client -> api: POST /reservations
api -> db: 1 transação: reter estoque + PENDING\n+ gravar ReservationHeld na outbox
db --> api: commit
api --> client: 201 · PENDING

== Iniciar as pendências e receber confirmação ==
worker -> db: Consultar outbox após o commit
db --> worker: ReservationHeld + outboxEventId estável
worker -> toOwner: Publicar ReservationHeld
worker -> db: Registrar published_at após envio
toOwner -> owner: Entregar trabalho ao responsável
owner -> fromOwner: ReservationConfirmationRequested\n+ após resolver TODAS as pendências
fromOwner -> worker: SQS entrega solicitação
worker -> db: Inbox + lock + relógio PostgreSQL\n+ decidir estado + gravar resultado na outbox
db --> worker: CONFIRMED ou rejeição de negócio
worker -> db: Consultar outbox do resultado
db --> worker: ReservationConfirmed ou ReservationConfirmationRejected
worker -> toOwner: Publicar resultado correlacionado
toOwner -> owner: Entregar desfecho da reserva

note over api,db #E7F4EF
  Outbox é uma tabela no PostgreSQL, não uma fila.
  A alteração da reserva e seu evento são atômicos.
  Se a publicação falhar, o evento continua para retry.
end note

note over toOwner,owner #FFF8E8
  O módulo externo só considera a reserva confirmada ao receber
  ReservationConfirmed. Mensagens podem repetir; cada lado usa idempotência.
  Inbox guarda (source, resolutionId). O Flash Booking não entende pagamento.
end note
@enduml

@startuml flash-booking-external-cancellation-aws
!include <awslib/AWSCommon.puml>
!include <awslib/Containers/ElasticContainerService.puml>
!include <awslib/Database/RDS.puml>
!include <awslib/ApplicationIntegration/SimpleQueueService.puml>

title Cancelamento confirmado — mesmo padrão de outbox e SQS
autonumber 1 1
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
skinparam ParticipantPadding 30
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam defaultFontSize 15

actor "Cliente / API caller" as client
box "Flash Booking · runtime local implementado; AWS ainda não aplicada" #EAF3FA
participant "Command API\n$ElasticContainerServiceIMG()" as api
participant "PostgreSQL RDS\n$RDSIMG()\nreserva · outbox · inbox" as db
participant "Worker ECS Fargate\n$ElasticContainerServiceIMG()" as worker
participant "reservation-to-owner\nAmazon SQS\n$SimpleQueueServiceIMG()" as toOwner
participant "reservation-from-owner\nAmazon SQS\n$SimpleQueueServiceIMG()" as fromOwner
end box
box "Outro sistema · responsável único; caixa-preta" #FFF3E3
participant "Responsável por todas\nas pendências\n(não implementado aqui)" as owner
end box

client -> api: DELETE /reservations/{id}
api -> db: 1 transação: CONFIRMED → CANCELLATION_PENDING\n+ gravar ReservationCancellationRequested na outbox
db --> api: commit
api --> client: 202 · cancelamento pendente
worker -> db: Publisher consulta a outbox
db --> worker: ReservationCancellationRequested
worker -> toOwner: Publicar pedido de cancelamento
toOwner -> owner: Entregar pedido
owner -> fromOwner: ReservationCancellationCompleted\n+ após resolver todas as obrigações
fromOwner -> worker: SQS entrega conclusão correlacionada
worker -> db: Inbox + conclusão + CANCELLED\n+ devolver estoque uma única vez
note over db #E7F4EF
  Até a conclusão positiva, o estado permanece CANCELLATION_PENDING
  e o estoque continua comprometido. O Flash Booking não executa nem
  acompanha a compensação externa.
end note
@enduml
